  "scope": "Checked data and conceptual answers, citation UI, and public Google search with explicit failure handling. No native ABI, CLI, operation ID or native result JSON changes.",
  "changes": [
    "Current-turn tool evidence registry; public answers have text and citation id/kind/ref triples.",
    "Complete sourced sentences are checked, preserving case-sensitive names and exact numeric text; unsupported paraphrases, stale references and web citations in data answers fail.",
    "Data output grammar permits only code-owned source placeholders and neutral introductions, never literal vertex IDs. Code renders facts on separate lines.",
    "One repair attempt after a rejected draft, then bare facts. Service failures fall back immediately. Every actual model request is captured separately.",
    "Saved result reads are revision-bound. Input descriptions, scalar results and selected fact follow-ups avoid an extra writer request.",
    "Sources drawer, visible citation provenance, no repeated answer/plan or repeated fact list, short traces, and admin-only Expert working notes.",
    "Public Google search uses no API key, stops at bot checks, labels bounded result excerpts, and provides an open-search link when blocked."
  ],
